ty:0;margin-bottom:48px;transform:translateY(20px);transition:opacity 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1), transform 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1)"><div><p style="font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.25em;font-family:&#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" class="text-xs tracking-[0.25em] uppercase text-yellow font-medium mb-3">Swing Optix®</p><h3 style="font-weight:300;line-height:1.1;font-family:&#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-light tracking-tight leading-[1.1]">Two angles.<br/>Every detail.</h3></div><p style="color:rgba(217, 216, 214, 0.6);max-width:325px" class="text-sm text-[#D9D8D6]/60 max-w-xs mt-4 md:mt-0 leading-relaxed">High-speed cameras capture your full swing from two synchronized perspectives — see your mechanics in motion.</p></div><div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(1, minmax(0, 1fr));gap:12px" class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3"><div class="relative group" style="opacity:0;transform:translateX(-30px);transition:opacity 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) 0.2s, transform 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) 0.2s"><div style="aspect-ratio:1/1;background-color:#393839;border-color:rgba(57, 56, 57, 0.8)" class="relative aspect-square bg-charcoal rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-charcoal/80"><img alt="Face-on camera view" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover object-bottom" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="/img/studio-package/face_on.webp"/></div><div style="background:linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8), transparent)" class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 p-5 bg-linear-to-t from-black/80 to-transparent rounded-b-xl"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1"><div style="width:6px;height:6px" class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-yellow animate-pulse"></div><span style="font-family: