 214, 0.7);max-width:450px" class="text-base leading-relaxed max-w-md mb-8 text-[#D9D8D6]/70">A front-mounted overhead launch monitor system that pairs three high-speed cameras, our largest hitting zone, 24 trusted ball and club data points, real-time swing visuals, and AI-powered feedback for a more complete and immersive training experience.</p><div style="row-gap:16px;column-gap:32px" class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-8 gap-y-4 pt-6 border-t border-charcoal"><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity 0.5s ease 0.6s, transform 0.5s ease 0.6s"><p style="color:rgba(217, 216, 214, 0.4);letter-spacing:0.15em;font-family:&#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.15em] uppercase">Mounting</p><p class="text-sm font-medium text-white">Front Overhead</p></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity 0.5s ease 0.7s, transform 0.5s ease 0.7s"><p style="color:rgba(217, 216, 214, 0.4);letter-spacing:0.15em;font-family:&#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.15em] uppercase">Data Points</p><p class="text-sm font-medium text-white">24</p></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity 0.5s ease 0.8s, transform 0.5s ease 0.8s"><p style="color:rgba(217, 216, 214, 0.4);letter-spacing:0.15em;font-family:&#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.15em] uppercase">Club Tracking</p><p class="text-sm font-medium text-white">Reflective stickers (required)</p></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity 0.5s ease 0.9s, transform 0.5s ease 0.9s"><p style="color:rgba(217, 216, 214, 0.4);letter-spacing:0.15em;font-family:&#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.15em] uppercase">Technology</p><p class="text-sm font-medium text-white">Infrared + Dimple Optix®</p></div></div></div></div></div></section></di