 text-[#D9D8D6]/70">AI-powered analysis turns your swing data and video into personalized coaching insights. Track progress over time, get drill recommendations, and train with purpose every session.</p><div style="row-gap:16px;column-gap:32px" class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-8 gap-y-4 pt-6 border-t border-charcoal"><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity 0.5s ease 0.6s, transform 0.5s ease 0.6s"><p style="color:rgba(217, 216, 214, 0.4);letter-spacing:0.15em;font-family:&#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.15em] uppercase">Included</p><p class="text-sm font-medium text-white">1 year</p></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity 0.5s ease 0.7s, transform 0.5s ease 0.7s"><p style="color:rgba(217, 216, 214, 0.4);letter-spacing:0.15em;font-family:&#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.15em] uppercase">Analysis</p><p class="text-sm font-medium text-white">AI-powered</p></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity 0.5s ease 0.8s, transform 0.5s ease 0.8s"><p style="color:rgba(217, 216, 214, 0.4);letter-spacing:0.15em;font-family:&#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.15em] uppercase">Performance Tracking</p><p class="text-sm font-medium text-white">Progress over time</p></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity 0.5s ease 0.9s, transform 0.5s ease 0.9s"><p style="color:rgba(217, 216, 214, 0.4);letter-spacing:0.15em;font-family:&#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.15em] uppercase">Guided Training</p><p class="text-sm font-medium text-white">Personalized drills</p></div></div></div></div></div></section></div><section class="bg-sand overflow-hidden "><div style="padding:80px 24px" class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 md:py-28"><div class="mb-12" style="margin-bottom:48px;opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px);transition:opacity 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1), transform 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1)"><p style="font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.25em;font-family:&#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" class="text-xs tracking-[0.25em] uppercase text-charcoal font-medium mb-3">Championship Courses</p><div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between gap-4"><h2 style="font-weight:300;line-height:1.1;font-family:&#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-light tracking-tight leading-[1.1]"><span class="font-medium">Play Anywhere.</span><br/>Anytime.</h2><p style="color:rgba(57, 56, 57, 0.8);max-width:400px" class="text-sm text-charcoal/80 max-w-sm leading-relaxed">Access a growing library of world-class courses with compatible simulation software.</p></div></div><div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));grid-auto-rows:140px;gap:0.75rem" class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-12 auto-rows-[140px] md:auto-rows-[150px] gap-3"><div class="relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden group cursor-pointer col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:row-span-3" style="grid-column:span 2 / span 2;opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px) scale(0.97);transition:opacity 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) 0.1s, transform 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) 0.1s"><div class="w-full h-full bg-charcoal flex items-center justify-center min-h-full"><img alt="Alaqua Lake CC" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="/img/software/golf_course_images/gameday/AlaquaLakes_00.webp"/></div><div class="absolute top-3 left-3 z-10"><span class="bg-yellow text-black text-[10px] font-bold tracking-wide uppercase px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md">New</span></div><div style="background:linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0,0,0,0.8), rgba(0,0,0,0.4), transparent)" class="abs