transparent)" class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 p-4 md:p-5 bg-linear-to-t from-black/80 via-black/40 to-transparent"><h4 class="text-white text-sm font-medium leading-none mb-0.5">Del Monte</h4><p style="color:rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5" class="text-white/50 text-xs">Monterey, CA</p></div><div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-2xl border border-transparent group-hover:border-yellow/30 transition-colors duration-300 pointer-events-none"></div></div></div></div></section><section class="bg-black text-white overflow-hidden "><div style="padding:80px 24px" class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 md:py-28"><div style="margin-bottom:64px" class="text-center mb-16"><h2 style="font-weight:300;font-family:&#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-light tracking-tight leading-[1.05]">See the Data Behind Every Swing.</h2></div><div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(1, minmax(0, 1fr));gap:24px" class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-6"><div style="position:relative" class="lg:col-span-3 relative"><div style="background-color:rgba(57, 56, 57, 0.5);border-color:rgba(57, 56, 57, 0.6)" class="aspect-16/10 h-full bg-charcoal/50 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-charcoal/60"><div class="w-full h-full flex items-center justify-center text-[#D9D8D6]/20 text-sm relative"><img alt="Swing data" loading="lazy" width="100" height="100" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-full h-full" style="color:transparent" src="/img/studio-package/see_the_data_behind_every_swing.webp"/></div></div></div><div style="gap:12px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr))" class="lg:col-span-2 grid grid-cols-2 gap-3"><div class="relative rounded-xl cursor-pointer select-none group" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity 0.5s ease 0.8s, transform 0.5s ease 0.8s"><div style="background-color:rgba(57, 56, 57, 0.5);border-color:rgba(57, 56, 57, 0.6);height:105px" class="bg-charcoal/30 border border-charcoal/50 rounded-xl px-4 py-4 flex flex-col justify-between h-full transition-colors duration-200 group-hover:border-yellow/20"><p style="letter-spacing:0.15em;color:rgba(217, 216, 214, 0.4);font-family:&#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-[#D9D8D6]/40 mb-2">Ball Speed</p></div><div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-xl bg-charcoal border border-yellow/30 px-4 py-3 flex flex-col justify-between pointer-events-none" style="clip-path:inset(100% 0 0 0 round 12px);transition:clip-path 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);background-color:#393839;border-color:rgba(255, 218, 0, 0.3)"><div><p style="font-size:11px;color:rgba(217, 216, 214, 0.7);font-family:&#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" class="text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-[#D9D8D6]/70">The speed of the ball immediately after impact. Higher ball speed generally means more distance.</p></div></div></div><div class="relative rounded-xl cursor-pointer select-none group" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity 0.5s ease 0.9s, transform 0.5s ease 0.9s"><div style="background-color:rgba(57, 56, 57, 0.5);border-color:rgba(57, 56, 57, 0.6);height:105px" class="bg-charcoal/30 border border-charcoal/50 rounded-xl px-4 py-4 flex flex-col justify-between h-full transition-colors duration-200 group-hover:border-yellow/20"><p style="letter-spacing:0.15em;color:rgba(217, 216, 214, 0.4);font-family:&#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-[#D9D8D6]/40 mb-2">Launch Angle</p></div><div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-xl bg-charcoal border border-yellow/30 px-4 py-3 flex flex-col justify-between pointer-events-none" style="clip-path:inset(100% 0 0 0 round 12px);transition:clip-path 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);background-color:#393839;border-color:rgba(255, 218, 0, 0.3)"><div><p style="font-size:11px;color:rgba(217, 216, 214, 0.7);font-family:&#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" class="text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-[#D9D8D6]/70">The vertical angle at which the ball leaves the clubface. Optimal launch varies by club.</p></div></div></div><div class="relative rounded-xl cursor-pointer select-none group" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity 0.5s ease 1s, transform 0.5s ease 1s"><div style="background-color:rgba(57, 56, 57, 0.5);border-color:rgba(57, 56, 57, 0.6);height:105px" class="bg-charcoal/30 border border-charcoal/50 rounded-xl px-4 py-4 flex flex-col justify-between h-full transition-colors duration-200 group-hover:border-yellow/20"><p style="letter-spacing:0.15em;color:rgba(217, 216, 214, 0.4);font-family:&#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-[#D9D8D6]/40 mb-2">Spin Rate</p></div><div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-xl bg-charcoal border border-yellow/30 px-4 py-3 flex flex-col justify-between pointer-events-none" style="clip-path:inset(100% 0 0 0 round 12px);transition:clip-path 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);background-color:#393839;border-color:rgba(255, 218, 0, 0.3)"><div><p style="font-size:11px;color:rgba(217, 216, 214, 0.7);font-family:&#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" class="text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-[#D9D8D6]/70">Revolutions per minute of the ball after impact. Affects trajectory shape, carry distance, and stopping power.</p></div></div></div><div class="relative rounded-xl cursor-pointer select-none group" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity 0.5s ease 1.1s, transform 0.5s ease 1.1s"><div style="background-color:rgba(57, 56, 57, 0.5);border-color:rgba(57, 56, 57, 0.6);height:105px" class="bg-charcoal/30 border border-charcoal/50 rounded-xl px-4 py-4 flex flex-col justify-between h-full transition-colors duration-200 group-hover:border-yellow/20"><p style="letter-spacing:0.15em;color:rgba(217, 216, 214, 0.4);font-family:&#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-[#D9D8D6]/40 mb-2">Carry</p></div><div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-xl bg-charcoal border border-yellow/30 px-4 py-3 flex flex-col justify-between pointer-events-none" style="clip-path:inset(100% 0 0 0 round 12px);transition:clip-path 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);background-color:#393839;border-color:rgba(255, 218, 0, 0.3)"><div><p style="font-size:11px;color:rgba(217, 216, 214, 0.7);font-family:&#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" class="text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-[#D9D8D6]/70">The distance the ball travels through the air before first hitting the ground. Excludes roll.</p></div></div></div><div class="relative rounded-xl cursor-pointer select-none group" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity 0.5s ease 1.2000000000000002s, transform 0.5s ease 1.2000000000000002s"><div style="background-color:rgba(57, 56, 57, 0.5);border-color:rgba(57, 56, 57, 0.6);height:105px" class="bg-charcoal/30 border border-charcoal/50 rounded-xl px-4 py-4 flex flex-col justify-between h-full transition-colors duration-200 group-hover:border-yellow/20"><p style="letter-spacing:0.15em;color:rgba(217, 216, 214, 0.4);font-family:&#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-[#D9D8D6]/40 mb-2">Club Speed</p></div><div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-xl bg-charcoal border border-yellow/30 px-4 py-3 flex flex-col justify-between pointer-events-none" style="clip-path:inset(100% 0 0 0 round 12px);transition:clip-path 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);background-color:#393839;border-color:rgba(255, 218, 0, 0.3)"><div><p style="font-size:11px;color:rgba(217, 216, 214, 0.7);font-family:&#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" class="text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-[#D9D8D6]/70">How fast the clubhead is moving at the moment of impact. The primary driver of potential distance.</p></div></div></div><div class="relative rounded-xl cursor-pointer select-none group" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity 0.5s ease 1.3s, transform 0.5s ease 1.3s"><div style="background-color:rgba(57, 56, 57, 0.5);border-color:rgba(57, 56, 57, 0.6);height:105px" class="bg-charcoal/30 border border-charcoal/50 rounded-xl px-4 py-4 flex flex-col justify-between h-full transition-colors duration-200 group-hover:border-yellow/20"><p style="letter-spacing:0.15em;color:rgba(217, 216, 214, 0.4);font-family:&#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-[#D9D8D6]/40 mb-2">Smash Factor</p></div><div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-xl bg-charcoal border border-yellow/30 px-4 py-3 flex flex-col justify-between pointer-events-none" style="clip-path:inset(100% 0 0 0 round 12px);transition:clip-path 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);background-color:#393839;border-color:rgba(255, 218, 0, 0.3)"><div><p style="font-size:11px;color:rgba(217, 216, 214, 0.7);font-family:&#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" class="text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-[#D9D8D6]/70">The ratio of ball speed to club speed. A measure of strike efficiency — closer to 1.50 means a more centered hit.</p></div></div></div><div class="relative rounded-xl cursor-pointer select-none group" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity 0.5s ease 1.4000000000000001s, transform 0.5s ease 1.4000000000000001s"><div style="background-color:rgba(57, 56, 57, 0.5);border-color:rgba(57, 56, 57, 0.6);height:105px" class="bg-charcoal/30 border border-charcoal/50 rounded-xl px-4 py-4 flex flex-col justify-between h-full transition-colors duration-200 group-hover:border-yellow/20"><p style="letter-spacing:0.15em;color:rgba(217, 216, 214, 0.4);font-family:&#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-[#D9D8D6]/40 mb-2">Club Path</p></div><div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-xl bg-charcoal border border-yellow/30 px-4 py-3 flex flex-col justify-between pointer-events-none" style="clip-path:inset(100% 0 0 0 round 12px);transition:clip-path 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);background-color:#393839;border-color:rgba(255, 218, 0, 0.3)"><div><p style="font-size:11px;color:rgba(217, 216, 214, 0.7);font-family:&#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" class="text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-[#D9D8D6]/70">The direction the clubhead is moving at impact relative to the target line.</p></div></div></div><div class="relative rounded-xl cursor-pointer select-none group" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity 0.5s ease 1.5s, transform 0.5s ease 1.5s"><div style="background-color:rgba(57, 56, 57, 0.5);border-color:rgba(57, 56, 57, 0.6);height:105px" class="bg-charcoal/30 border border-charcoal/50 rounded-xl px-4 py-4 flex flex-col justify-between h-full transition-colors duration-200 group-hover:border-yellow/20"><p style="letter-spacing:0.15em;color:rgba(217, 216, 214, 0.4);font-family:&#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-[#D9D8D6]/40 mb-2">Face Angle</p></div><div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-xl bg-charcoal border border-yellow/30 px-4 py-3 flex flex-col justify-between pointer-events-none" style="clip-path:inset(100% 0 0 0 round 12px);transition:clip-path 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);background-color:#393839;border-color:rgba(255, 218, 0, 0.3)"><div><p style="font-size:11px;color:rgba(217, 216, 214, 0.7);font-family:&#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" class="text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-[#D9D8D6]/70">Where the clubface is pointing at impact relative to the target line. Primarily determines the ball&#x27;s starting direction.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><div class="h-1.5 w-full bg-yellow"></div><div class="" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(32px);transition:opacity 800ms cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) 0ms, transform 800ms cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) 0ms, filter 800ms cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) 0ms;will-change:opacity, transform"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 "><div style="padding:64px 0px"><div class="border-t border-[#D9D8D6] "><div class="border border-[#D9D8D6] border-x-0 border-t-0"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between py-5 text-left cursor-pointer"><span class="text-base font-medium">Specifications</span><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="transition-transform duration-[250ms ease] "><path d="M8 3v10M3 8h10"></path></svg></button><div style="max-height:0px" class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-[250ms ease]"><div class="pb-6"><div style="row-gap:16px" class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-x-12 gap-y-4"><div><p class="text-[#898886] mb-1 text-sm">Mounting</p><p class="font-medium text-sm">Front-mounted (ceiling)</p></div><div><p class="text-[#898886] mb-1 text-sm">Tracking Technology</p><p class="font-medium text-sm">High-speed infrared cameras</p></div><div><p class="text-[#898886] mb-1 text-sm">Club Tracking</p><p class="font-medium text-sm">Reflective stickers required</p></div><div><p class="text-[#898886] mb-1 text-sm">Swing Cameras</p><p class="font-medium text-sm">Swing Optix® (included)</p></div><div><p class="text-[#898886] mb-1 text-sm">Software</p><p class="font-medium text-sm">AI Trainer — 1 year included</p></div><div><p class="text-[#898886] mb-1 text-sm">Connectivity</p><p class="font-medium text-sm">Ethernet</p></div><div><p class="text-[#898886] mb-1 text-sm">PC Required</p><p class="font-medium text-sm">Yes</p></div><div><p class="text-[#898886] mb-1 text-sm">3rd Party Compatibility</p><p class="font-medium text-sm">Yes</p></div><div><p class="text-[#898886] mb-1 text-sm">Trouble Mat Compatible</p><p class="font-medium text-sm">Yes<