Box="0 0 14 14" fill="none"><circle cx="7" cy="7" r="7" fill="var(--color-yellow)"></circle><path d="M4 7.2l2 2L10 5.5" stroke="var(--color-black)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span>Dynamic Loft</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none"><circle cx="7" cy="7" r="7" fill="var(--color-yellow)"></circle><path d="M4 7.2l2 2L10 5.5" stroke="var(--color-black)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span>Impact Point (Vertical, Horizontal)</span></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="border border-[#D9D8D6] border-x-0 border-t-0"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between py-5 text-left cursor-pointer"><span class="text-base font-medium">Dimensions</span><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="transition-transform duration-[250ms ease] "><path d="M8 3v10M3 8h10"></path></svg></button><div style="max-height:0px" class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-[250ms ease]"><div class="pb-6"><div style="row-gap:16px" class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-x-12 gap-y-4"><div><p class="text-[#898886] mb-1 text-sm">Without Mounting Brakcet</p><p class="font-medium text-sm">36.3&quot; L</p><p class="font-medium text-sm">5.9&quot; W</p><p class="font-medium text-sm">2.5&quot; H</p></div><div><p class="text-[#898886] mb-1 text-sm">With Mounting Brakcet</p><p class="font-medium text-sm">36.3&quot; L</p><p class="font-medium text-sm">5.9&quot; W</p><p class="font-medium text-sm">4.3&quot; H</p></div><div><p class="text-[#898886] mb-1 text-sm">Hitting Zone</p><p class="font-medium text-sm">21&quot; L</p><p class="font-medium text-sm">28&quot; W</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="border border-[#D9D8D6] border-x-0 border-t-0"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between py-5 text-left cursor-pointer"><span class="text-base font-medium">What&#x27;s in the Box</span><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="transition-transform duration-[250ms ease] "><path d="M8 3v10M3 8h10"></path></svg></button><div style="max-height:0px" class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-[250ms ease]"><div class="pb-6"><ul class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-sm text-charcoal"><li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-yellow mt-0.5 text-[8px]">●</span> <!-- -->EYE XO2 Launch Monitor Unit</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-yellow mt-0.5 text-[8px]">●</span> <!-- -->Swing Optix® Cameras (x2)</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-yellow mt-0.5 text-[8px]">●</span> <!-- -->1-Year AI Trainer</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-yellow mt-0.5 text-[8px]">●</span> <!-- -->Quick Start Guide</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-yellow mt-0.5 text-[8px]">●</span> <!-- -->Mounting Bracket</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-yellow mt-0.5 text-[8px]">●</span> <!-- -->Calibration Board</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-yellow mt-0.5 text-[8px]">●</span> <!-- -->Uneekor Trouble Mats (Bunker and Rough)</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-yellow mt-0.5 text-[8px]">●</span> <!-- -->Level</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-yellow mt-0.5 text-[8px]">●</span> <!-- -->Club Stickers (x400)</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-yellow mt-0.5 text-[8px]">●</span> <!-- -->11ft Power Cable, Adapter, and Connector</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-yellow mt-0.5 text-[8px]">●</span> <!-- -->USB Ethernet Adapter</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-yellow mt-0.5 text-[8px]">●</span> <!-- -->60ft CAT6 LAN Cable</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-yellow mt-0.5 text-[8px]">●</span> <!-- -->M4 32mm Screws (x9) + 1 Spare</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-yellow mt-0.5 text-[8px]">●</span> <!-- -->M6 15mm Screws (x9) + 1 Spare</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-yellow mt-0.5 text-[8px]">●</span> <!-- -->M6 15mm High Screws (x4)</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-yellow mt-0.5 text-[8px]">●</span> <!-- -->M6 15mm Low Screws (x4)</li></ul></div></div></div><div class="border border-[#D9D8D6] border-x-0 border-t-0"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between py-5 text-left cursor-pointer"><span class="text-base font-medium">System Requirements</span><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="transition-transform duration-[250ms ease] "><path d="M8 3v10M3 8h10"></path></svg></button><div style="max-height:0px" class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-[250ms ease]"><div class="pb-6"><div><div style="row-gap:16px" class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-x-12 gap-y-4"><div><p class="text-[#898886] mb-1 text-sm">Operating System</p><p class="font-medium text-sm">Windows 10 Home or Pro (64-bit only)</p></div><div><p class="text-[#898886] mb-1 text-sm">Processor</p><p class="font-medium text-sm">Intel Core Ultra 5, Intel Core i5 (12th Gen or later), AMD Ryzen 5 (5000 Series or later)</p></div><div><p class="text-[#898886] mb-1 text-sm">RAM</p><p class="font-medium text-sm">32 GB (32 GB for Swing Optix® &amp; AI-Trainer)</p></div><div><p class="text-[#898886] mb-1 text-sm">Graphics</p><p class="font-medium text-sm">NVIDIA RTX 3060 Ti or equivalent</p></div><div><p class="text-[#898886] mb-1 text-sm">Graphics Memory</p><p class="font-medium text-sm">8 GB (VIEW + AI-Trainer Only)</p></div><div><p class="text-[#898886] mb-1 text-sm">Dedicated Ethernet Ports</p><p class="font-medium text-sm">1 or more (one required for launch monitor)</p></div><div><p class="text-[#898886] mb-1 text-sm">Internet Download Speed</p><p class="font-medium text-sm">25 Mbps or higher</p></div><div><p class="text-[#898886] mb-1 text-sm">Room Width</p><p class="font-medium text-sm">13 ft minimum</p></div><div><p class="text-[#898886] mb-1 text-sm">Ceiling Height</p><p class="font-medium text-sm">10 ft minimum recommended</p></div></div><p class="pt-6 text-sm font-medium">Disclaimer: The recommended PC specification is mandatory for data-intensive products like AI Trainer.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="border border-[#D9D8D6] border-x-0 border-t-0"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between py-5 text-left cursor-pointer"><span class="text-base font-medium">Resources</span><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="transition-transform duration-[250ms ease] "><path d="M8 3v10M3 8h10"></path></svg></button><div style="max-height:0px" class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-[250ms ease]"><div class="pb-6"><div style="row-gap:16px" class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-x-12 gap-y-4"><div><p class="text-[#898886] mb-1 text-sm">Guide</p><a class="hover:underline" href="https://download.uneekor.com/docs/EYEXO2_Manual.pdf"><p class="font-medium text-sm">EYE XO2 User Manual</p></a></div><div><p class="text-[#898886] mb-1 text-sm">Software</p><a class="hover:underline" href="https://download.uneekor.com/dist/Uneekor/UneekorLauncher/UneekorLauncher_Setup.exe"><p class="font-medium text-sm">Uneekor Launcher</p></a></div><div><p class="text-[#898886] mb-1 text-sm">Setup</p><a target="_blank" class="hover:underline" href="https://youtu.be/KutcoEbI-Wc?si=-AGHxVBryDKVFiA5"><p class="font-medium text-sm">Watch Setup Video</p></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(32px);transition:opacity 800ms cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) 0ms, transform 800ms cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) 0ms, filter 800ms cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) 0ms;will-change:opacity, transform"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 "><section style="padding:64px 0px" class="py-[64px] "><div class="text-center pb-12"><h2 style="font-weight:300;font-family:&#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-light tracking-tight">Frequently Asked Questions</h2><p style="max-width:600px" class="text-sm text-charcoal pt-3 max-w-xl mx-auto">Don&#x27;t see what you&#x27;re looking for? View all our FAQ&#x27;s<!-- --> <a class="text-charcoal underline" href="/support/faqs">here</a>, or reach out to us any time using<!-- --> <a class="text-charcoal underline" href="tel:8882626498">phone</a> <!-- -->or<!-- --> <a class="text-charcoal underline" href="mailto:support@uneekor.com">email</a>.</p></div><div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto"><div><div class="border border-[#D9D8D6] border-x-0 border-t-0 last:border-b-0"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between py-6 text-left cursor-pointer group"><span class="text-base font-medium text-black pr-8">What are the space requirements?</span><span style="background-color:#F5F4F2" class="shrink-0 w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#F5F4F2] text-charcoal group-hover:bg-[#D9D8D6] transition-colors"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="transition-transform duration-[250ms ease] "><path d="M8 3v10M3 8h10"></path></svg></span></button><div style="max-height:0px" class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-[250ms ease]"><p class="text-sm text-charcoal leading-relaxed pb-6">We recommend a minimum room size of 13 ft wide × 16 ft deep × 10 ft high. This ensures comfortable clearance for your swing and proper sensor coverage from the rear-mounted EYE XO2 unit.</p></div></div><div class="border border-[#D9D8D6] border-x-0 border-t-0 last:border-b-0"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between py-6 text-left cursor-pointer group"><span class="text-base font-medium text-black pr-8">What&#x27;s included in the AI Studio?</span><span style="background-color:#F5F4F2" class="shrink-0 w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#F5F4F2] text-charcoal group-hover:bg-[#D9D8D6] transition-colors"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="transition-transform duration-[250ms ease] "><path d="M8 3v10M3 8h10"></path></svg></span></button><div style="max-height:0px" class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-[250ms ease]"><p class="text-sm text-charcoal leading-relaxed pb-6">The Uneekor AI Studio includes the EYE XO2 front-mounted overhead launch monitor, a pair of Swing Optix® cameras for real-time swing replay, a 1-year Al Trainer subscription for personalized coaching insights, and 3-month trial of the Ultimate software package.</p></div></div><div class="border border-[#D9D8D6] border-x-0 border-t-0 last:border-b-0"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between py-6 text-left cursor-pointer group"><span class="text-base font-medium text-black pr-8">Do I need additional software subscriptions?</span><span style="background-color:#F5F4F2" class="shrink-0 w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#F5F4F2] text-charcoal group-hover:bg-[#D9D8D6] transition-colors"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="transition-transform duration-[250ms ease] "><path d="M8 3v10M3 8h10"></path></svg></span></button><div style="max-height:0px" class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-[250ms ease]"><p class="text-sm text-charcoal leading-relaxed pb-6">AI Trainer is included for 1 year. A base Player subscription is also included at no charge. You can optionally upgrade to Pro, Champion, or Ultimate for access to third-party software, additional courses, and more profiles.</p></div></div><div class="border border-[#D9D8D6] border-x-0 border-t-0 last:border-b-0"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between py-6 text-left cursor-pointer group"><span class="text-base font-medium text-black pr-8">How do I activate my AI Trainer license?</span><span style="background-color:#F5F4F2" class="shrink-0 w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#F5F4F2] text-charcoal group-hover:bg-[#D9D8D6] transition-colors"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="transition-transform duration-[250ms ease] "><path d="M8 3v10M3 8h10"></path></svg></span></button><div style="max-height:0px" class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-[250ms ease]"><p class="text-sm text-charcoal leading-relaxed pb-6">Once your Swing Optix cameras are registered in Launcher, your AI Trainer license will automatically be added to your account and available for activation.</p></div></div><div class="border border-[#D9D8D6] border-x-0 border-t-0 last:border-b-0"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between py-6 text-left cursor-pointer group"><span class="text-base font-medium text-black pr-8">Does the AI Studio work with third-party software?</span><span style="background-color:#F5F4F2" class="shrink-0 w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#F5F4F2] text-charcoal group-hover:bg-[#D9D8D6] transition-colors"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="transition-transform duration-[250ms ease] "><path d="M8 3v10M3 8h10"></path></svg></span></button><div style="max-height:0px" class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-[250ms ease]"><p class="text-sm text-charcoal leading-relaxed pb-6">Yes. With a Pro subscription or higher, you can connect to supported third-party golf simulation software for an expanded library of courses and gameplay modes.</p></div></div><div class="border border-[#D9D8D6] border-x-0 border-t-0 last:border-b-0"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between py-6 text-left cursor-pointer group"><span class="text-base font-medium text-black pr-8">How is the EYE XO2 mounted?</span><span style="background-color:#F5F4F2" class="shrink-0 w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#F5F4F2] text-charcoal group-hover:bg-[#D9D8D6] transition-colors"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="transition-transform duration-[250ms ease] "><path d="M8 3v10M3 8h10"></path></svg></span></button><div style="max-height:0px" class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-[250ms ease]"><p class="text-sm text-charcoal leading-relaxed pb-6">The EYE XO2 is front-mounted overhead on the ceiling in front the golfer. This keeps the unit completely out of the hitting zone for a clean, safe, and space-efficient setup.</p></div></div><div class="border border-[#D9D8D6] border-x-0 border-t-0 last:border-b-0"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between py-6 text-left cursor-pointer group"><span class="text-base font-medium text-black pr-8">Do I need stickers on my clubface?</span><span style="background-color:#F5F4F2" class="shrink-0 w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#F5F4F2] text-charcoal group-hover:bg-[#D9D8D6] transition-colors"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="transition-transform duration-[250ms ease] "><path d="M8 3v10M3 8h10"></path></svg></span></button><div style="max-height:0px" class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-[250ms ease]"><p class="text-sm text-charcoal leading-relaxed pb-6">Yes. The EYE XO2 requires reflective clubface stickers to capture full club data.</p></div></div></div></div></section></div></div><div class="" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(32px);transition:opacity 800ms cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) 0ms, transform 800ms cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) 0ms, filter 800ms cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) 0ms;will-change:opacity, transform"><section class="bg-sand "><div style="padding:80px 24px" class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 md:py-28"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-20"><div><h2 style="font-weight:300;font-family:&#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-light tracking-tight leading-[1.1] text-black mb-4">Still have questions?</h2><p style="max-width:500px;color:rgba(57, 56, 57, 0.7)" class="text-base text-charcoal/70 leading-relaxed max-w-md mb-8">Our team has helped thousands of golfers build their perfect simulator setup. We&#x27;re here to help you find the right fit.</p><div class="space-y-4"><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><div style="height:4px;width:4px;margin-top:10px" class="w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-yellow mt-2.5 shrink-0"></div><div><p style="font-family:&#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" class="text-sm font-medium text-black leading-none">Free consultation</p><p style="color:rgba(57, 56, 57, 0.5);font-family:Helvetica, Arial, Sans-serif" class="text-xs text-charcoal/50">No pressure, no obligation</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><div style="height:4px;width:4px;margin-top:10px" class="w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-yellow mt-2.5 shrink-0"></div><div><p style="font-family:&#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" class="text-sm font-medium text-black leading-none">Expert setup guidance</p><p style="color:rgba(57, 56, 57, 0.5);font-family:Helvetica, Arial, Sans-serif" class="text-xs text-charcoal/50">Room layout, mounting, and configuration</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><div style="height:4px;width:4px;margin-top:10px" class="w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-yellow mt-2.5 shrink-0"></div><div><p style="font-family:&#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" class="text-sm font-medium text-black leading-none">Financing options</p><p style="color:rgba(57, 56, 57, 0.5);font-family:Helvetica, Arial, Sans-serif" class="text-xs text-charcoal/50">Flexible plans starting at $208/m