ing replay, a 1-year Al Trainer subscription for personalized coaching insights, and 3-month trial of the Ultimate software package.\"},{\"question\":\"Do I need additional software subscriptions?\",\"answer\":\"AI Trainer is included for 1 year. A base Player subscription is also included at no charge. You can optionally upgrade to Pro, Champion, or Ultimate for access to third-party software, additional courses, and more profiles.\"},{\"question\":\"How do I activate my AI Trainer license?\",\"answer\":\"Once your Swing Optix cameras are registered in Launcher, your AI Trainer license will automatically be added to your account and available for activation.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the AI Studio work with third-party software?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. With a Pro subscription or higher, you can connect to supported third-party golf simulation software for an expanded library of courses and gameplay modes.\"},{\"question\":\"How is the EYE XO2 mounted?\",\"answer\":\"The EYE XO2 is front-mounted overhead on the ceiling in front the golfer. This keeps the unit completely out of the hitting zone for a clean, safe, and space-efficient setup.\"},{\"question\":\"Do I need stickers on my clubface?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. The EYE XO2 requires reflective clubface stickers to capture full club data.\"}],\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"subtitle\":[\"Don't see what you're looking for? View all our FAQ's\",\" \",[\"$\",\"$L19\",null,{\"href\":\"/support/faqs\",\"className\":\"text-charcoal underline\",\"children\":\"here\"}],\", or reach out to us any time using\",\" \",[\"$\",\"$L19\",null,{\"href\":\"tel:8882626498\",\"className\":\"text-charcoal underline\",\"children\":\"phone\"}],\" \",\"or\",\" \",[\"$\",\"$L19\",null,{\"href\":\"mailto:support@uneekor.com\",\"className\":\"text-charcoal underline\",\"children\":\"email\"}],\".\"]}]}]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"3c:[\"$\",\"$L2e\",null,{\"animation\":\"fade-up\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L50\",null,{}]}]\n